{"sha": "a8fa83b899acd702f51195650cc25542c1f0f823cceb846721bb548acbb55302", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:hilbert} 章 --- 希尔伯特空间}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:hilbert:1}", "(a) 实数情形：展开 $\\norm{x \\pm y}^2 = \\norm x^2 \\pm 2\\langle", "x,y\\rangle + \\norm y^2$，相减即得。复情形（内积", "关于第二变元线性）：仿上式展开，", "\\[", "\\langle x, y\\rangle = \\frac14\\sum_{k=0}^{3}", "\\iu^k\\,\\bigl\\|\\iu^kx + y\\bigr\\|^2,", "\\]", "每一项贡献 $\\iu^k\\cdot2\\operatorname{Re}\\bigl(", "(-\\iu)^k\\langle x,y\\rangle\\bigr)$，其和为 $4\\langle", "x,y\\rangle$（逐一检验 $k$ 的四个取值；$\\sum\\iu^k", "(\\norm x^2 + \\norm y^2) = 0$）。", "", "(b) $L^1$ 情形：$f = \\mathbf 1_{\\intcc0{1/2}}$，$g = \\mathbf", "1_{\\intcc{1/2}1}$：$\\norm{f\\pm g}_1^2 = 1$（两式各自），和为 $2$；", "$2\\norm f_1^2 + 2\\norm g_1^2 = 1 \\neq 2$。上确界范数：$f =", "\\mathbf 1$，$g(t) = t$ 定义于 $\\intcc01$：$\\norm{f + g}_\\infty^2 +", "\\norm{f-g}_\\infty^2 = 4 + 1 = 5 \\neq 4 = 2 + 2$。由于不满足", "平行四边形法则，这些范数都不由任何内积诱导", "（内积必满足此式，直接展开即可验证）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:hilbert:2}", "(a) $p(f) = \\bigl(\\int_0^1f\\bigr)\\mathbf 1$：事实上 $f - \\int f", "\\perp$ 与常数正交（$\\int(f - \\int f)c = 0$）。在均方意义下，", "$f$ 的最佳常数逼近即其\\emph{平均值} ---", "这是条件期望的第一个实例", "（见\\cref{ch:b3:probability}）。", "", "(b) $p(f) = f\\,\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{1/2}1}$：其差", "$f\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc0{1/2}}$ 与每个 $g$", "（在 $\\intcc0{1/2}$ 上为零）正交。", "", "(c) $d^2 = \\bigl\\|x - \\tfrac12\\bigr\\|_2^2 = \\int_0^1(x -", "\\tfrac12)^2\\dd x = \\tfrac1{12}$：$d = \\frac1{2\\sqrt3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:hilbert:3}", "(a) 该等价性即\\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:decomposition}", "（$\\bar F = (F^\\perp)^\\perp$，且 $\\bar F = H \\iff F^\\perp =", "\\{0\\}$）。例：由有限数列组成的空间 $F$ 在", "$\\ell^2$ 中稠密（截断），且为真子空间：$F^\\perp = \\{0\\}$，但 $F", "\\neq \\ell^2$ --- 对于非闭子空间，$H = F \\oplus", "F^\\perp$ 显然不成立（$F \\oplus \\{0\\} \\neq H$）。", "", "(b) $\\abs{\\langle x_n, y_n\\rangle - \\langle x, y\\rangle} \\leq", "\\abs{\\langle x_n - x, y_n\\rangle} + \\abs{\\langle x, y_n -", "y\\rangle} \\leq \\norm{x_n - x}\\sup_n\\norm{y_n} + \\norm", "x\\,\\norm{y_n - y} \\to 0$（收敛数列有界）。", "用于 \\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:parseval}(1) 中，说明 $x - \\lim", "S_N \\perp e_k$，并用于 \\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:decomposition}", "中，说明 $F^\\perp = \\bar F^{\\,\\perp}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:hilbert:4}", "$e_0 = \\frac1{\\sqrt2}$。其次，$x \\perp \\mathbf 1$ 已成立", "（$\\int_{-1}^1x = 0$），且 $\\int_{-1}^1x^2 = \\frac23$：$e_1 =", "\\sqrt{\\tfrac32}\\,x$。再取 $x^2 - \\langle e_0, x^2\\rangle e_0 =", "x^2 - \\frac13$（由奇偶性知 $\\perp e_1$），并有", "\\[", "\\int_{-1}^1\\Bigl(x^2 - \\frac13\\Bigr)^2\\dd x = \\frac25 -", "\\frac49 + \\frac29 = \\frac{8}{45}:", "\\qquad e_2 = \\sqrt{\\tfrac{45}8}\\,\\Bigl(x^2 - \\frac13\\Bigr).", "\\]", "比较：$P_0 = 1$，$P_1 = x$，$P_2 = \\frac{3x^2 - 1}2$，则", "$\\sqrt{n + \\tfrac12}\\,P_n$ 给出 $\\frac1{\\sqrt2}$，", "$\\sqrt{\\frac32}x$，$\\sqrt{\\frac52}\\,\\frac{3x^2-1}2 =", "\\sqrt{\\frac{45}8}\\bigl(x^2 - \\frac13\\bigr)$，恰为 $e_0, e_1,", "e_2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:hilbert:5}", "对 $f(t) = t$：$c_0 = 0$，由分部积分得 $c_n =", "\\frac{\\iu(-1)^n}{n}$，当 $n \\neq 0$ 时，$\\abs{c_n}^2 =", "\\frac1{n^2}$。由帕塞瓦尔恒等式：", "\\[", "\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^\\pi t^2\\dd t = \\frac{\\pi^2}3", "= \\sum_{n\\neq0}\\frac1{n^2} = 2\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^2}", "\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}6 .", "\\]", "对 $f(t) = t^2$：$c_0 = \\frac{\\pi^2}3$，$c_n =", "\\frac{2(-1)^n}{n^2}$（$n \\ne 0$）。由帕塞瓦尔恒等式：", "\\[", "\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}t^4\\dd t = \\frac{\\pi^4}5", "= \\frac{\\pi^4}9 + \\sum_{n\\neq0}\\frac4{n^4}", "\\ \\Longrightarrow\\", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^4} = \\frac18\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi^4}5 -", "\\frac{\\pi^4}9\\Bigr) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90} .", "\\]", "无需分段 $\\mathcal C^1$ 之类的附加条件：", "由\\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:fourier}即可覆盖每个 $L^2$ 函数。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:hilbert:6}", "(a) $\\varphi(f) = \\int_0^{1/2}f = \\langle\\mathbf", "1_{\\intcc0{1/2}},\\ f\\rangle$：代表元为 $a =", "\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc0{1/2}}$，且 $\\norm\\varphi = \\norm a_2 =", "\\frac1{\\sqrt2}$（见\\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:riesz}）。", "", "(b) 取帐篷函数 $f_n$，其峰值 $1$ 位于", "$\\frac12$ 处，支集宽为 $\\frac2n$：$f_n(\\tfrac12) = 1$", "而 $\\norm{f_n}_2^2 \\leq \\frac2n \\to 0$，故不存在常数 $C$", "使得 $\\abs{f(\\frac12)} \\leq C\\norm f_2$。点求值", "在 $L^2$ 中没有意义 --- 元素是模去", "零测集的等价类，而本题的计算正是其定量上的原因。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:hilbert:7}", "(a) 记 $M = \\sup_k\\norm{x_k}$。标量数列", "$(\\langle e_n, x_k\\rangle)_k$ 均以 $M$ 为界：由对角线", "抽取法可得子列 $x_{k_j}$，使得 $\\langle e_n, x_{k_j}\\rangle", "\\to \\gamma_n$（对每个 $n$）。对每个 $N$，$\\sum_{n\\leq", "N}\\abs{\\gamma_n}^2 = \\lim_j\\sum_{n\\leq N}\\abs{\\langle e_n,", "x_{k_j}\\rangle}^2 \\leq M^2$（由贝塞尔不等式），故 $(\\gamma_n) \\in", "\\ell^2$，且 $x = \\sum_n\\gamma_ne_n \\in H$", "（见\\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:parseval}(3)）。对 $y \\in H$：", "\\[", "\\abs{\\langle y, x_{k_j} - x\\rangle}", "\\leq \\Bigl|\\sum_{n\\leq N}\\overline{c_n(y)}\\bigl(\\langle e_n,", "x_{k_j}\\rangle - \\gamma_n\\bigr)\\Bigr|", "+ 2M\\Bigl(\\sum_{n>N}\\abs{c_n(y)}^2\\Bigr)^{1/2},", "\\]", "利用展开式 $\\langle y, z\\rangle =", "\\sum\\overline{c_n(y)}c_n(z)$，并对尾项使用柯西–施瓦茨不等式；", "先取 $N$，再取 $j$：弱收敛于 $x$。", ""]}